    "Fearful reactions are normal, especially for new experiences. Here's how to help your puppy feel more confident.": {
      "comment": "A description under the header section, explaining that fearful reactions are normal and providing guidance on how to help a puppy feel more confident.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ängstliche Reaktionen sind normal, besonders bei neuen Erfahrungen. So hilfst du deinem Welpen, selbstbewusster zu werden."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las reacciones de miedo son normales, especialmente para nuevas experiencias. Asi es como ayudar a tu cachorro a sentirse mas seguro."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les réactions de peur sont normales, surtout pour les nouvelles expériences. Voici comment aider votre chiot à se sentir plus confiant."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le reazioni paurose sono normali, specialmente per nuove esperienze. Ecco come aiutare il tuo cucciolo a sentirsi più sicuro."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fearful reactions are normal, especially for Ny experiences. Here's how Till Hjälp your Valp feel Mer confident."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Angstige reacties zijn normaal, vooral bij nieuwe ervaringen. Zo help je je puppy zelfverzekerder te worden."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
